<%!-- Hero Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl text-center">
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl/12 tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-6xl text-olive-950 dark:text-white">
      Our Story
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg/7 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-balance">
      How a simple idea became a platform for collective accountability.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%!-- Origin Story Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-3xl">
    <div class="prose prose-olive dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-8">
        The Problem We Saw
      </h2>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10 mb-12">
        <p class="text-lg text-olive-700 dark:text-olive-200 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          We've all been there. A company breaks its promises. An institution fails to
          protect the people it serves. A leader refuses to acknowledge their mistakes.
          You speak up, and nothing happens.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-olive-700 dark:text-olive-200 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Individual voices are easy to ignore. Complaints get buried in customer service
          queues. Concerns are dismissed as isolated incidents. The powerful have
          learned that silence is their greatest ally.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-olive-700 dark:text-olive-200 leading-relaxed">
          But what if those individual voices could find each other? What if scattered
          complaints could become a unified demand that's impossible to ignore?
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-8">
        The Spark
      </h2>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10 mb-12">
        <p class="text-lg text-olive-700 dark:text-olive-200 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Apology.io was born from a simple observation: petitions are powerful, but
          they often lack specificity. They say "we want change" without documenting
          exactly what went wrong and who is responsible.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-olive-700 dark:text-olive-200 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          We wanted to create something different. A platform where grievances are
          documented in detail. Where the responsible parties are named. Where the
          demand for accountability is clear and specific.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-olive-700 dark:text-olive-200 leading-relaxed">
          Not just "we want an apology" - but "here are the specific wrongs, here are
          the people who must answer for them, and here are the thousands of voices
          demanding they do so."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%!-- Vision Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10 bg-olive-950/[0.025] dark:bg-white/5">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-8 text-center">
      Where We're Going
    </h2>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 0 8.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 1-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 0 1 7.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 0 0-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0 1 12 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0 1 21 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0 1 12 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Global Reach
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          Accountability knows no borders. We're building a platform that can
          amplify voices around the world, in any language, against any institution.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Verified Impact
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          We're developing ways to track and verify when initiatives lead to real
          change - public acknowledgments, policy changes, and genuine accountability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 8.25h9m-9 3H12m-9.75 1.51c0 1.6 1.123 2.994 2.707 3.227 1.129.166 2.27.293 3.423.379.35.026.67.21.865.501L12 21l2.755-4.133a1.14 1.14 0 0 1 .865-.501 48.172 48.172 0 0 0 3.423-.379c1.584-.233 2.707-1.626 2.707-3.228V6.741c0-1.602-1.123-2.995-2.707-3.228A48.394 48.394 0 0 0 12 3c-2.392 0-4.744.175-7.043.513C3.373 3.746 2.25 5.14 2.25 6.741v6.018Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Community Tools
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          Discussion forums, update tracking, and direct communication channels
          to help communities organize and maintain pressure for accountability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Transparency Reports
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          Regular reports on platform usage, successful initiatives, and patterns
          of accountability - or the lack thereof - across industries and institutions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%!-- Join Us Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-3xl">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-olive-950 dark:bg-white p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-white dark:text-olive-950 mb-4">
        Join the Movement
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-olive-200 dark:text-olive-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Every signature matters. Every voice counts. Together, we can make
        silence impossible and accountability inevitable.
      </p>
      <.link
        navigate={~p"/"}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-olive-950 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-olive-950 dark:text-white hover:bg-olive-100 dark:hover:bg-olive-800 transition"
      >
        Browse Active Initiatives
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
        </svg>
      </.link>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
